# Raw and third-party data are NOT redistributed from here. Every source is
# public and is cited by accession in the manuscript and in DATA-SOURCES.md.
# Redistributing GWAS summary statistics and the cell atlas is not ours to do.
data/
env/
work/
work_dm/
logs/
figures/

# Large derived matrices. These are results, but they are hundreds of megabytes
# of per-cell scores; they belong in the Zenodo archive, not in git history.
results/scdrs/*.score.tsv
results/scdrs_axis/*.score.tsv
results/scdrs_mouse/*.score.tsv
results/obs_axis.tsv
results/obs_node.tsv
results/gsmap/
results/spotlevel/
results/spotlevel_depthmatched/
results/genediag/

# Working notes, self-critique logs and manuscript drafts. These are internal
# deliberation, not the record of the analysis, and several contain claims that
# were later withdrawn. Publishing them would misrepresent the study.
*.md
!README.md
!PREREGISTRATION.md
!DATA-SOURCES.md

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

